                "text": "The Universal Service Fund plays an essential role in connecting schools, hospitals, and families in rural, Tribal, and underserved communities across the country to reliable and affordable internet.\n \nI am pleased the Supreme Court has ruled to uphold the Universal Service Fund and ensure that it can continue to connect these communities to reliable broadband.",
