                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It\u2019s almost 1 a.m. in Washington. I just walked off the Senate floor after calling out the GOP\u2019s budget for what it is: a plan to rip away health care, shut down rural hospitals, take food off the tables of kids, seniors, and veterans \u2014 and add $3 TRILLION to the national debt. https://t.co/cNsuJq94TE",
