                "retweet_count": 21,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Senate Republicans just passed a disastrous budget bill \u2013 rushed through to meet President Trump\u2019s demands, not to help American families.\n\nIt guts health care for kids and families, slashes food assistance, and puts rural hospitals and grocery stores on the brink \u2013 all to fund massive tax breaks for the ultra-wealthy.\n\nAnd it adds over $3 trillion to the national debt, driving up costs for working families, farmers, and small businesses.\n\nThis is a betrayal of the American people we were elected to serve.",
