                "reply_count": 15,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It\u2019s Monday afternoon, and the devastating numbers from the Republican Budget Betrayal are starting to come in.\n \nHere\u2019s what we know so far:\n- Adds $4 trillion to the national debt\n- 17 million Americans could lose their health care\n- 300+ rural hospitals and 500+ nursing homes at risk of closure\n- $500 billion cut from clean energy, risking 16.5% higher energy bills in New Mexico and 11,800 lost jobs\n\n@SenateDems forced one of the longest Vote-a-Ramas in history to fight it every step of the way.",
