                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Yesterday, I visited Holy Cross Medical Center in Taos and met with hospital leadership, providers, and local officials to discuss the vital role rural hospitals play in our communities. In many cases, they are the difference between life and death. The Republican Budget Betrayal slashes critical funding \u2013 threatening rural hospitals and putting the health and safety of New Mexicans at risk.",
